Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:51:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Perf: a [system] line with the CPU, its instruction sets,
 cores and RAM

A report from a slow computer is hard to read without them. Printed once at start-up, whatever the performance setting.
